stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Login: User authenticates
    Login --> TokenIssued: JWT generated (15 min expiry)
    TokenIssued --> Active: Token stored in browser

    state Active {
        [*] --> ValidToken
        ValidToken --> APIRequest: User makes request
        APIRequest --> ValidToken: Token attached automatically
    }

    Active --> Expired: Token expires after 15 minutes
    Expired --> Refreshed: Auto-refresh via refresh token
    Refreshed --> Active: New token issued

    Active --> Blacklisted: User logs out
    Active --> Blacklisted: New login from another device
    Expired --> SessionEnded: Refresh also expired

    Blacklisted --> [*]: Token revoked in Redis
    SessionEnded --> [*]: Redirect to login page

    note right of Active
        HTTP Interceptor automatically
        attaches token to every request
    end note

    note right of Blacklisted
        Single-session policy:
        Only one active session per user
    end note
